[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3082174633","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108636#issuecomment-3082174633","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108636","id":3082174633,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63tkCp","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T02:01:17Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T02:01:58Z","body":"> Will be nice to add in support for hardware resolve but I think this covers the most pressing use case.\r\n\r\nI suspect hardware resolve is faster on supported hardware. But even it may be emulated on TBDR devices. See the ARM documentation linked above. Mali devices can't merge subpasses that change the depth/stencil buffer which means that they will have to resolve the depth buffer in a separate pass anyway. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3082174633/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3082192404","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108636#issuecomment-3082192404","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108636","id":3082192404,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63toYU","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T02:08:29Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T02:08:29Z","body":"> I suspect hardware resolve is faster on supported hardware. But even it may be emulated on TBDR devices. See the ARM documentation linked above. Mali devices can't merge subpasses that change the depth/stencil buffer which means that they will have to resolve the depth buffer in a separate pass anyway.\r\n\r\nIndeed, and right now with the primary use case for which I did the original work now no longer being an issue (as everyone in XR land who actually uses this is switching to the ASW/frame synthesis approach for which a lower res depth buffer is rendered), and the remaining use cases all target devices where its questionable the API is supported and would even be faster, I don't think this is top of the priority list.\r\n\r\nIn due time, if we have a spare minute, it would be interesting to bring up my PR and do comparisons, but I don't think there is a pressing need right now.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3082192404/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3084138307","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108636#issuecomment-3084138307","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108636","id":3084138307,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc631DdD","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T13:44:32Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T13:44:32Z","body":"> Indeed, and right now with the primary use case for which I did the original work now no longer being an issue (as everyone in XR land who actually uses this is switching to the ASW/frame synthesis approach for which a lower res depth buffer is rendered)\r\n\r\nI think there's still potential use cases for it. For example, allowing `XR_FB_composition_layer_depth_test` to be used with projection layers (which would remove the need for \"hole punching\" and all of its caveats), or a potential future world where multiple applications can provide projection layers to be composited together","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3084138307/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303818582","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108636#issuecomment-3303818582","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108636","id":3303818582,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E7EVW","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T16:48:58Z","updated_a